  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "adṛṣṭapūrvaṃ saṅkruddhaṃ dṛṣṭvā rāmaṃ sa lakṣmaṇaḥ",
   "abravītprāñjalirvākyaṃ mukhena pariśuṣyatā"
